 <metadata>
  <name>Mairead's circle</name>
  <desc>Run down Higher Lane, down Dales Lane.  Right at the Goats Gate along RnR then turn left onto Bury New Road for a short while before turning right onto Rufford Lane, follow that down until you turn right on Parr Lane,  then run until you reach the gym turning right just before and run up to Morrison, turn left onto Bury New Road and return to start</desc>
  <author>
   <name>Run Together Whitefield</name>
   <link href="https://www.strava.com/athletes/44862010"/>
  </author>
